{"speciesId":179,"names":{"fr":"Wattouat","es":"Mareep","en":"Mareep","ja":"メリープ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If static elec­ tricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MAREEP’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail grows."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MAREEP’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail grows."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more energy is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa laine fournie enfle lorsqu’il accumule de l’électricité statique. Son contact peut choquer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa laine fournie enfle lorsqu’il accumule de l’électricité statique. Son contact peut choquer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When cold weather increases static electricity, its wool doubles in size and the tip of its tail glows slightly."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When cold weather increases static electricity, its wool doubles in size and the tip of its tail glows slightly."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa laine fournie enfle lorsqu’il accumule de l’électricité statique. Son contact peut choquer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su pelaje lanudo dobla su volumen al acumular electricidad estática. Tocarlo puede dar calambre."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ふわふわの 体毛は 静電気が たまると ２倍に ふくらむ。 触ると 感電してしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il garde une grande quantité d’air dans sa toison pour ne pas subir les variations de température."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Almacena aire en el lanudo pelaje que tiene. Así, se mantiene fresco en verano y caliente en invierno."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ふかふかの 体毛は 空気を たくさん 含んで 夏は 涼しく 冬は 温かいのが 特徴。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"L’épaisse fourrure cotonneuse de Wattouat se charge d’électricité statique lorsqu’on la frotte. Plus elle est chargée, plus l’ampoule au bout de sa queue est lumineuse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mareep tiene un pelaje lanudo suave que produce carga estática por el roce. Cuanto más se carga de electricidad estática, más brilla la bombilla que tiene en el extremo de la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mareep’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体毛が こすれて 静電気が たまる。 電力が 沢山 たまるほど 尻尾の 先に ついた 電球が 明るく 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"L’épaisse fourrure cotonneuse de Wattouat se charge d’électricité statique lorsqu’on la frotte. Plus elle est chargée, plus l’ampoule au bout de sa queue est lumineuse."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mareep tiene un pelaje lanudo suave que produce carga estática por el roce. Cuanto más se carga de electricidad estática, más brilla la bombilla que tiene en el extremo de la cola."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mareep’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体毛が こすれて 静電気が たまる。 電力が 沢山 たまるほど 尻尾の 先に ついた 電球が 明るく 光る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En raison de leur tendance à stocker l’électricité statique, les vêtements en laine de Wattouat subissent un traitement spécial."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las prendas elaboradas con la lana de Mareep se cargan fácilmente de electricidad estática y requieren de tratamientos especiales."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Clothing made from Mareep’s fleece is easily charged with static electricity, so a special process is used on it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"メリープの 毛で 作った 衣服は 静電気が たまりやすい ので 特殊な 加工が されている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il a beau être mignon, sa laine génère de l’électricité quand on la frotte. Tentez de le caresser, et il vous mettra vite au courant !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su lana acumula electricidad estática con la fricción. Al ser tan adorable, la gente se acerca para acariciarlo y se lleva un doloroso chispazo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Rubbing its fleece generates electricity. You’ll want to pet it because it’s cute, but if you use your bare hand, you’ll get a painful shock."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"綿毛が こすれ 電気が たまる。 かわいいからと 素手で 触ると バチッと 痺れて 痛いのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":179,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"egg",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[13,"tutor",0],[13,"xd-purification",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[3,"egg",0],[4,"egg",0],[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[7,"egg",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[14